\[
\frac{1}{L_{\text{mix}}} = \frac{1}{L_{\text{mix}} \text{ (methane)}} + \frac{1}{L_{\text{mix}} \text{((methane-1}) + \frac{1}{L_{\text{mix}} \text{(methane-2}} + \frac{1}{L_{\text{mix}} \text{ (methane-3}}}
\]
where \( L_{\text{mix}} \) is the flignability limit of the mixture, and \( L_{\text{mix}} \text{(methane-i)} \) is the flignaneity limit of the \( i \)-th component.
