   \[
   \frac{\Delta \lambda}{\lambda} = \frac{\Delta \lambda}{\lambda}_0 - \beta
   \]
   where \(\Delta \lambda\) is the observed wavelength, \(\lambda\) is the emitted wavelength, and \(\Delta \(\lambda_0\) is the observed wavelength for the case where \(\beta = 0\).

